# ── NEVER COMMIT THESE ────────────────────────────────
# Your GitHub fine-grained PAT (plaintext)
.github-token

# Encrypted token vault — safe to commit, but useless without the passphrase
admin/token.enc

# Local env file used by the admin scripts
admin/.env

# The admin dashboard IS committed now (admin/index.html) — it is hosted on
# GitHub Pages and intentionally public: it carries ZERO secrets. The GitHub
# PAT lives only in the admin's browser localStorage; without it the page is
# just a login screen and GitHub rejects every write attempt.

# Node bits
node_modules/
package-lock.json